From 5eddd612817bf855857f95109dd53fc6a3d9d49e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:08:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: 25 packs - RAMS_10, RQOS_126, RDSH_101 reworded and
 translated

RAMS_10: the AiMesh page's "starts once setup is done" notice. RQOS_126:
"Optional download cap" for the Classful card. RDSH_101 (header tooltip,
LAN name check) said "Details: System Log." while rdnshc logs only
failures and recoveries; it now says exactly that, translated in every
pack (it was English in all 25), each naming its own System Log title.
Lockstep 7230 -> 7232. Lean: test_landns_tooltip_text.py,
test_qos_card_chips.py, test_aimesh_interop.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
